// ---- Coda: the hold, and home -----------------------------------------------
section Coda bars=6 tempo=58
// E held over Fadd9 (Hinata's head on horns and cellos), then G, then Gm6.
// The orchestra lets go; the glass alone steps down to D; the wind chime
tempo       | . | >56 | >52 | 50 | >48 | 66 |
